          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.6 × 10^(－6)</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>0.9 × 10^(－6)</choice_text>
          <commentary>0.9 × 10^-6 J이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1.2 × 10^(－6)</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
